This rereview read the original review, Task 8 brief, appended implementer report, and the supplied `cbbc9c9..284b04f` fix package as the primary view, followed only by scoped source/test lines and directly affected call contracts needed to verify C1/I1-I4 and the new composition issue. I ran no pytest, Docker, provider/OpenRouter/network operation, real SDK construction, live pricing, replay, parity execution, backtest, permanent-ledger mutation, background process, upload, push, merge, deploy, or cloud action. The only filesystem write was this ignored rereview report. Tracked files, index, HEAD, and branch were not changed.
